OL,3,GNEWSAUnexploded WW2 bomb towed away
OL,4,Afrom Falmouth Docks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA World War Two bomb has been towed
OL,7,Faway from Falmouth Docks to an
OL,8,Fexclusion zone in Falmouth Bay, police
OL,9,Fhave said
OL,11,FAbout 2,000 people from more than 300
OL,12,Fhomes in Falmouth who were evacuated
OL,13,Fhave now been told they can return
OL,15,FEmergency services were initially
OL,16,Fcalled to Falmouth Docks at 09:15 BST
OL,17,Fon Monday after the suspected 250lb
OL,18,F(115kg) American World War Two
OL,19,Fair-dropped device was found in the
OL,20,Fwater
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
