OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1790182546
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAUnexploded WW2 bomb towed away
OL,4,Afrom Falmouth Docks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 300m (984ft) exclusion zone was in
OL,7,Fplace on Tuesday which has then
OL,8,Fexpanded to 755m (2,477ft) on Wednesday
OL,9,Fmorning - this has since been removed
OL,11,FA "flurry of activity" was reported at
OL,12,Fabout 15:30 as guard boats moved into
OL,13,Fposition in the docks, with onlookers
OL,14,Ftaking to Cliff Road with binoculars to
OL,15,Fwatch as the bomb was moved
OL,17,FGWR has suspended its train services
OL,18,Fbetween Falmouth Docks and Falmouth
OL,19,FTown stations until the end of the day
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
